      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/2011744745500860480",
      "text": "[11:10AM]. \n#Apongbon\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nMovement inward Apongbon underneath the bridge from Broad street is still looking good .\n\nUBA Roundabout inward Inner marina and Apongbon underneath the bridge are in order as well.\n\nJourney inward Offin Canal descending CMS bridge is still in good shape.\nLeventis, Elegbata and Ebute Ero connecting Eko bridge are still in good shape.\n\nDrive responsibly!\n#FollowLASTMA",
